Inheritance:- It is an IS-A relationship where child class acquires all the properties and behaviours of parent class using the extends keyword.
-----------

uses:
-----
1. code reusability
2. achieving method overiding (promotes runtime polymorphism)

Types:
1. single level (class A extends class B)
2. multilevel (A->B->C)
3. Hierarchical (A->B, A->C)
4. Multiple (does not support to avoid ambiguity)

